Qoraal marka: ['html'] samee: { <- (
		naf
		beddel: ['&'] ku: ['&amp;'],
		beddel: ['<'] ku: ['&lt;'],
		beddel: ['>'] ku: ['&gt;'],
		beddel: ['"'] ku: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Liis cusub.

['Verbatim Syntax'] xarfaha mid-kasta: { :tiro :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (tiro), Letter: letter).
}.

Soo-saar list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list isku-dar: ['↵']).

Soo-saar qor: template.

